      "KAREN: Bello, Felicity.\nFELICITY: Thought you might want some meat.\nKAREN: That's kind of you.\nFELICITY: Shot it on your land. I've got time for a drink, I. guess.",
      "FELICITY: Don't know I'd fit in there. It sounds quite fancy.\nKAREN: Try to learn something useful: they woulén't do that for me. Then you can stand alone. If you care to.\nPELICITY: D'you like being alone?\nKAREN: No.",
      "KAREN ': What does Juma know about the bottom of the sea?\nKAREN: Even British. It's called dreaming.",
      "KAREN: Circumstances.\nFELICITY: I don't understand how anyone can live there: all those little streets. Pasty people. To hell with them all, I say."
